    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im back in london after like a 14 hour flight from singapore and im feeling kinda weird. my chest feels a bit tight and i keep getting winded just walking to the kitchen, and my left calf is actually kinda sore and swollen too. is this just like jet lag or maybe just being dehydrated from the flight? i dont wanna go to the er if i dont have to but im feeling pretty wiped out.",
